dbbcfe302dac"],

Cell["\<\
Branch with latest string-code version is feat/canonicalize-utils. Please \
clone this branch to compute the notebook.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0043729635007887`*^9, 4.004373007688178*^9}, {
  4.00437306172383*^9, 
  4.004373068366496*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b48e8063-8d34-4ffe-956c-\
7eee6d2170ad"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Vanilla string-code takes a long time for computing level n=2,3 brackets. \
Level 2 computes in around 10h, level 3 takes more time. You can ask your \
favorite LLM to provide you with an optimized pipeline to run the string-code \
engine. An LLM-optimized version was used to compute the n=3 results recorded \
in the paper. LLM post-processing was also used to solve the system of \
equations that determines the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["C", "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "09cb8e72-0e72-43a5-a832-f36464bf1275"],
 " completion candidates, as well as the field-redefinition F_H from the \
diffeomorphism analysis."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.004373074409893*^9, 4.004373083378209*^9}, {
   4.0043731356765757`*^9, 4.004373174289955*^9}, {4.004373430847196*^9, 
   4.00437345465053*^9}, 4.0043735882893877`*^9, {4.004373709384716*^9, 
   4.00437371010469*^9}, {4.0043737427090607`*^9, 
   4.004373838420903*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"032d0889-4123-4b75-a85d-\
a5e17dedd2b7"],

